  "description": "Jaekyung, who has a hard time forming deep relationships with people, takes charge of the remodeling project for an amusement park and hotel enterprise. While taking a look around the park to gain a better understanding for the project, he comes across lighthearted Taehee who is dressed as a bear mascot, and is drawn to him despite not wanting to be. Taehee approaches the typically detached Jaekyung, and proposes a no-strings-attached relationship for the two to enjoy. However...\n\n(Source: BomToon, translated)",
